@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ada",
  "email": "ada@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "secreta"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "secreta"
}

### Perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear película
POST {{baseUrl}}/pelicula
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Dune",
  "sinopsis": "Un desierto y un destino.",
  "imagen": "https://example.com/dune.jpg"
}

### Listado
GET {{baseUrl}}/pelicula?nombre=dune&pagina=1&limite=5
